            "expanded_content": "<p>We ship worldwide. If you do not see your destination listed upon checkout, please <a href=\"mailto:commune237@gmail.com\" title=\"mailto:commune237@gmail.com\">contact us</a>.</p><p>All order will be processed within 3 business day. We are not responsible for lost, stolen, or damaged shipments caused by courier. You are responsible for any duties and taxes that may apply upon delivery. Due to the nature of secondhand goods, all sales are finals, returns will not be accepted. Placing an order indicates your acceptance of our delivery and return policy.</p>"
